        <div class="flexcontainer">
            <div class="Ingredients">
                <h2>Ingredients:</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Water</li>
                    <li>Barilla Pasta</li>
                    <li>3 Tomatoes</li>
                    <li>1 onion</li>
                    <li>Feta cheese</li>
                    <li>Olive Oil</li>
                    <li>Salt</li>
                    <li>Garlic</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="Pasta">
                <ol>
                    <li>Take a pan and fill it with water and boil it on the stove.</li>
                    <li>Take a box of pasta and open it and pour it in the pan</li>
                    <li>Boil the pasta in the water until it is smooth</li>
                    <li>Drain the water and put the pasta in a different pan.</li>
                    <li>Cut your onions, tomatoes and garlic.</li>
                    <li>Take the cheese and cut it and put it in the pan</li>
                    <li>Serve it in a plate.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>

